  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large clay or ceramic tagine over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and garlic and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the carrots and potatoes and cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Stir in the tagine spice mix and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chicken broth and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 20-25 minutes, or until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Garnish with parsley and serve hot."
